cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below, and also cite Buys, Polak and Zuiddam (arXiv:2607.29681), on whose Lean framework it is built, and, for C13, Matthew Protti's repository (tag v0.5.0)."
title: "Slightly improved lower bounds for the Shannon capacity of C13, C15 and C19, formalised in the Buys-Polak-Zuiddam Lean framework"
abstract: "Lean 4 certificates for Theta(C15) >= 7.301635000991096 and Theta(C19) >= 9.357203012726939 (v1.0), and Theta(C13) >= 6.302927071589786 (v1.1, improving M. Protti's 6.302927046770772), each as a patch on the BPZ ShannonBounds repository at commit aa21eeb, with one-command checkers."
